WEBVTT

00:04.575 --> 00:11.777
Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~

00:12.950 --> 00:19.685
No matter where
you are, I'll find you.

00:21.091 --> 00:28.122
I can only watch you...
I can't even talk to you.

00:28.232 --> 00:32.692
Today is going to end,
and we can't see tomorrow.

00:33.270 --> 00:35.898
But they'll turn into a gentle color.

00:37.541 --> 00:44.003
It whirls down from
the sky... Love will shine.

00:44.481 --> 00:52.513
<i>When I turn around,
I always see your smile.</i>

00:53.824 --> 01:01.230
1 wish a day like that would come.

01:01.465 --> 01:09.304
I want to keep
looking at you up close.

01:10.073 --> 01:16.535
I'm sending these great
feelings that never end...

01:16.747 --> 01:21.707
...straight to you.

01:38.235 --> 01:40.135
Ayuki, come here.

01:40.637 --> 01:42.264
Come here, Ayuki!

01:42.973 --> 01:44.270
Hurry, hurry!

01:45.075 --> 01:46.542
Take a look.

01:46.677 --> 01:49.737
This pupa is trying hard
to become a butterfly.

01:59.389 --> 02:01.016
It was...

02:01.158 --> 02:03.285
...very fragile...

02:03.393 --> 02:05.520
...and weak...

02:06.196 --> 02:10.724
That's how hard
the butterfly tries in order to fly.

02:13.303 --> 02:15.430
It was hesitant...

02:15.539 --> 02:18.599
...about getting touched...

02:27.017 --> 02:31.647
Someday, you'll be pretty
and fly away like that...

02:33.991 --> 02:34.958
No.

02:35.225 --> 02:37.785
I don't want to...

02:38.195 --> 02:38.929
And...

02:38.929 --> 02:40.330
And...
I don't have to be...

02:40.330 --> 02:41.331
...it was beautiful.
I don't have to be...

02:41.331 --> 02:42.031
...it was beautiful.

02:42.032 --> 02:42.665
...it was beautiful.
..like that.

02:42.666 --> 02:43.189
...like that.

02:43.300 --> 02:48.761
Just Watching

02:49.906 --> 02:51.771
A test of courage?

02:52.542 --> 02:53.509
Correct.

02:53.610 --> 02:56.306
I need some new data.

02:56.480 --> 02:59.040
You and your data...

02:59.616 --> 03:03.313
I read that earthlings have
this event to test one's courage...

03:03.420 --> 03:05.820
...and deepen romantic relations.

03:05.922 --> 03:07.290
Sol want you to try it.

03:07.290 --> 03:08.655
<i>So I want you to try it.
Where's that?</i>

03:08.759 --> 03:09.453
Here.

03:09.559 --> 03:11.083
You can read this?

03:11.194 --> 03:12.024
Sort of...

03:12.129 --> 03:12.596
Are you sure?

03:12.596 --> 03:14.962
Are you sure?
I want to see it too!

03:19.102 --> 03:22.970
Why do you want me
to experience romance all the time?

03:23.073 --> 03:25.871
I need the data for
romantic relationships!

03:25.976 --> 03:28.774
But you never get things going!

03:28.879 --> 03:31.177
Anyway, it's a no! I'm scared!

03:31.281 --> 03:32.315
I'm definitely not doing it!

03:32.315 --> 03:34.283
I'm definitely not doing it!
Don't worry about it.

03:34.418 --> 03:37.683
I'll keep an eye
on you near the gravesite.

03:37.854 --> 03:39.151
Gravesite?

03:39.289 --> 03:42.224
We already picked
a location for this event!

03:42.692 --> 03:45.684
All the arrangements
have been made.

03:45.796 --> 03:46.592
Puu!

03:47.097 --> 03:48.564
Of course!

03:48.799 --> 03:53.259
You can use the facility as much as
you want for educational purposes!

03:53.370 --> 03:57.067
So at 8 PM tonight,
we'll have a voluntary event...

03:57.174 --> 03:59.972
...to test your
courage at Kashima High.

04:00.077 --> 04:01.445
So that's how it is...

04:01.445 --> 04:03.106
So that's how it is...
I think it'll be fun.

04:03.213 --> 04:06.808
Yeah, we haven't had any fun
since we went to the beach.

04:06.917 --> 04:10.250
<i>No way! I really
hate tests of courage!</i>

04:10.687 --> 04:14.623
You're really something. Especially
when we go to haunted houses.

04:14.724 --> 04:15.748
Something?

04:15.926 --> 04:19.692
This scaredy-cat just clings
to you and never lets go!

04:20.797 --> 04:22.788
Stop saying that, Tomari.

04:23.233 --> 04:26.327
Clings on and never lets go...

04:27.571 --> 04:29.971
I just heard a strange noise...

04:30.373 --> 04:32.307
Don't you worry.

04:32.876 --> 04:33.843
Really?

04:35.645 --> 04:36.612
Yeah.

04:36.813 --> 04:38.576
I'll protect you.

04:39.149 --> 04:40.446
I'm so happy.

04:40.550 --> 04:41.539
Hazumu.

04:41.651 --> 04:42.084
But this was the reality

04:42.085 --> 04:43.386
But this was the reality
I'm scared...

04:43.386 --> 04:44.978
But this was the reality
Stop pulling.

04:45.622 --> 04:47.988
I can hear your heart beating.

04:48.091 --> 04:51.822
Thump, thump, thump...
It's beating so fast.

04:51.928 --> 04:53.725
Are you scared too?

04:54.197 --> 04:57.325
No, it's beating so fast because...

04:58.335 --> 05:00.235
...you're so cute...

05:01.938 --> 05:03.030
What's wrong?

05:03.140 --> 05:04.437
It's hot...

05:04.741 --> 05:07.505
Soro, I'm starting
the supplementary class!

05:07.611 --> 05:08.737
Coming...

05:09.079 --> 05:11.604
I guess I'll go to practice.

05:15.485 --> 05:19.182
Don't be so disappointed.
I'll go with you if you're scared.

05:19.523 --> 05:21.855
Really? Are you really serious?

05:21.958 --> 05:25.086
It's frustrating if you
want me to go that badly...

05:25.395 --> 05:27.590
Don't practice too hard!

05:27.964 --> 05:32.196
Don't collapse from sunstroke!
I want you full of energy tonight!

05:32.302 --> 05:33.326
Yeah, yeah.

05:33.436 --> 05:34.926
Till tonight!

05:35.038 --> 05:36.130
Hazumu.

05:36.840 --> 05:37.534
What?

05:37.641 --> 05:40.940
Where's Yasuna? You usually
water the plants together.

05:41.044 --> 05:44.480
Yeah, but Fermata
has a checkup today.

05:44.581 --> 05:45.673
Fermata?

05:46.149 --> 05:47.946
Yasuna's dog.

05:48.084 --> 05:49.608
Oh, I see.

05:49.719 --> 05:52.984
Don't get an upset stomach
from drinking too much water!

05:53.089 --> 05:54.147
Yeah, yeah.

05:55.759 --> 05:58.319
So much for being timid...

06:00.197 --> 06:02.131
<i>Now, what should I do?</i>

06:05.202 --> 06:08.296
Feels good, right? I'll give you plenty.

06:09.973 --> 06:11.133
I'm sorry.

06:13.710 --> 06:16.008
I can't accept this sort of thing.

06:16.112 --> 06:17.602
Ayuki?

06:17.914 --> 06:20.314
You like someone else?

06:20.517 --> 06:21.814
That's right.

06:22.519 --> 06:25.317
But that's none of your business.

06:25.455 --> 06:28.253
I guess you're right. Oh well...

06:38.201 --> 06:41.170
I'm sorry.
I wasn't trying to eavesdrop...

06:41.271 --> 06:42.238
It's okay.

06:42.439 --> 06:44.498
But it's just...

06:44.708 --> 06:47.609
Is it weird? For me to like someone?

06:47.944 --> 06:50.139
No! Not at all!

06:50.247 --> 06:53.580
It's just, you know... Give it your all!

06:55.218 --> 06:57.049
<i>No, I won't.</i>

06:58.355 --> 07:00.346
I won't try at all.

07:01.458 --> 07:03.983
I don't intend to get on the stage.

07:11.935 --> 07:15.268
The gate's open,
but she's not home?

07:22.212 --> 07:23.509
What's that?

07:23.613 --> 07:24.910
Excuse me.

07:29.219 --> 07:30.311
It's open.

07:30.420 --> 07:31.648
Hello?

07:33.990 --> 07:37.187
What? I'm not suspicious, you know!

07:37.661 --> 07:40.528
Calm down, um... Ferret!

07:47.804 --> 07:51.501
Fermata! What are
you doing outside?

07:55.979 --> 07:58.140
<i>I'm sorry I wasn't home.</i>

07:58.248 --> 08:01.217
No, it's my fault
for dropping by like that.

08:01.318 --> 08:03.286
These are the pictures.

08:03.386 --> 08:07.322
I'll make more prints today, so I
was wondering if you wanted any.

08:07.424 --> 08:09.892
Thank you for bringing these.

08:21.538 --> 08:23.028
Ah, this...

08:23.807 --> 08:25.866
Hazumu looks happy.

08:26.176 --> 08:27.404
Yeah.

08:27.677 --> 08:30.043
Maybe because you're there.

08:31.381 --> 08:34.077
It's probably because you were.

08:37.153 --> 08:39.451
I wonder if that's true.

08:47.063 --> 08:48.860
Well, see ya...

08:51.034 --> 08:54.003
I'm sure you'll get
a call from Hazumu...

08:54.704 --> 08:59.266
We're having a test of courage at
school tonight. You should come too.

09:01.344 --> 09:02.311
Okay.

09:02.412 --> 09:03.470
See ya.

09:06.015 --> 09:10.349
I changed my mind!
You guys go on without me!

09:10.820 --> 09:13.311
Acting like a total kid...

09:13.757 --> 09:15.987
No!

09:16.993 --> 09:18.961
But this is just...

09:19.229 --> 09:20.321
Perfect!

09:20.897 --> 09:23.627
My daughter is in a tantrum crying!

09:23.733 --> 09:26.827
This is the kind of life
I wanted with my daughter!

09:26.936 --> 09:29.734
<i>I want you to annoy me some more!</i>

09:30.407 --> 09:32.034
You're so mean...

09:33.209 --> 09:35.643
Now cry for me some more! Cry!

09:35.912 --> 09:37.675
You two!

09:42.519 --> 09:44.384
Why me?

09:45.288 --> 09:47.483
We'll be late if we don't hurry.

09:50.126 --> 09:51.821
Victory panties, okay.

09:51.928 --> 09:53.520
Victory bra, okay.

09:53.630 --> 09:55.894
Victory clothes, okay!

09:56.132 --> 10:00.535
I'm Namiko Tsuki, 35 years old
and never had a boyfriend.

10:00.637 --> 10:04.903
I know it's wrong
to seduce a man, but...

10:05.008 --> 10:07.568
But ll really want him!

10:07.677 --> 10:11.113
Please, God! Let me
get away with this! Bam!

10:11.981 --> 10:13.415
Sorry to keep you waiting.

10:13.416 --> 10:14.348
Sorry to keep you waiting.
Eep.

10:14.517 --> 10:17.247
Oh... Mr. Sora?

10:17.420 --> 10:20.048
Why are you dressed like that?

10:20.790 --> 10:22.815
Can't you tell by looking?

10:22.926 --> 10:24.757
A ghost, right?

10:25.428 --> 10:29.626
I want to observe Osaragi and
the others' behavior by scaring them.

10:29.966 --> 10:31.194
No, no!

10:31.301 --> 10:34.600
I want you to scare
me instead of them.

10:34.971 --> 10:35.903
Look.

10:37.974 --> 10:41.603
Your thighs? Then I'll show you mine.

10:42.712 --> 10:45.442
You're wearing
victory underwear too...

10:46.049 --> 10:47.880
That's...

10:48.251 --> 10:51.550
I tried to make it look
as real as possible.

10:51.654 --> 10:52.621
Bye.

10:54.891 --> 10:58.327
Mr. Sora looks good as a ghost too!

11:00.864 --> 11:02.161
It's dark...

11:02.265 --> 11:04.995
Of course. It's night.

11:05.602 --> 11:09.436
Now, you'll form pairs
and go around the building.

11:09.539 --> 11:13.669
Then you'll go to the roof
and bring back the token of proof.

11:13.776 --> 11:17.542
Your partners will
be chosen randomly.

11:18.014 --> 11:21.108
What? Why don't we all go at once?

11:21.251 --> 11:24.448
Don't be silly!
That wouldn't be any fun!

11:24.821 --> 11:26.721
Okay, I'm going first.

11:26.823 --> 11:27.949
Let's see...

11:28.191 --> 11:29.317
This one!

11:29.826 --> 11:31.453
It's a heart!

11:31.561 --> 11:33.119
Next person.

11:33.229 --> 11:35.026
This might be good.

11:35.131 --> 11:38.589
Besides, I'm the only guy...
Even if ll don't get Hazumu...

11:38.701 --> 11:42.137
Okay, now find the person
with the same mark!

11:42.238 --> 11:43.569
I got a heart!

11:43.673 --> 11:46.141
The one with the heart goes it alone.

11:47.410 --> 11:52.370
Everyone knew this was going
to happen, but I'm such a...

11:53.716 --> 11:56.651
I'm glad you're my partner, Tomari!

11:56.853 --> 11:59.617
Don't start pulling me yet...

12:31.754 --> 12:33.813
Tomari, where are you?

12:33.923 --> 12:35.584
Right next to you.

12:35.692 --> 12:37.990
Really? You're really there?

12:38.094 --> 12:40.153
Just open your eyes and walk.

12:40.263 --> 12:41.525
But...

12:43.132 --> 12:45.623
It's dark! I'm scared!

12:45.735 --> 12:46.702
Hey.

12:46.803 --> 12:48.704
No! ll can't do this, Tomari!

12:48.705 --> 12:51.697
No! ll can't do this, Tomari!
Okay, okay. Just don't pull my shirt.

12:51.874 --> 12:53.739
Then I'll do this.

12:53.843 --> 12:58.143
We won't fall if we move our
right feet at the same time, right?

12:59.048 --> 13:00.515
Oh well...

13:01.150 --> 13:05.086
You're not doing this deliberately...

13:05.355 --> 13:06.989
What? Did you say something?

13:06.990 --> 13:09.049
What? Did you say something?
It's nothing...

13:09.158 --> 13:12.059
<i>I wanted to do this with everyone!</i>

13:15.064 --> 13:17.123
Let's go home already!

13:17.900 --> 13:20.300
What are you saying? Let's go.

13:20.403 --> 13:22.598
Right, left, right, left.

13:22.705 --> 13:23.205
Right, left, right, left, right, left...

13:23.206 --> 13:25.834
Right, left, right, left, right, left...
Go slower, Tomari!

13:37.020 --> 13:38.078
Um...

13:38.254 --> 13:39.380
Tomari...

13:40.089 --> 13:44.458
...said something to you, right?
You can tell by looking at her.

13:44.560 --> 13:46.187
Yes...

13:46.996 --> 13:48.691
It's about Hazumu?

13:48.798 --> 13:49.696
Yes.

13:50.667 --> 13:55.127
I guess Tomari is ready
to take the stage now.

13:56.005 --> 13:58.303
And how do you feel?

13:59.976 --> 14:02.240
I guess I feel relieved...

14:03.613 --> 14:07.276
I'm relieved since she
told me about it honestly.

14:08.017 --> 14:13.887
<i>I'm sure Kurusu really likes Hazumu
as well, so I was kind of happy.</i>

14:14.323 --> 14:17.759
<i>That there's someone who
feels the same way I do...</i>

14:18.561 --> 14:21.291
<i>I know it's weird, but...</i>

14:23.132 --> 14:24.690
You're pretty now.

14:29.672 --> 14:34.234
Maybe you're beginning
to spread your wings.

14:37.380 --> 14:38.574
No!

14:38.881 --> 14:39.939
Hazumu?

14:40.149 --> 14:42.982
Why don't you go? I'll stay.

14:43.119 --> 14:44.051
But...

14:44.253 --> 14:47.017
You like Hazumu, don't you?

14:51.461 --> 14:53.725
<i>Can I ask you something?</i>

14:55.098 --> 14:57.658
Why are you always
by Hazumu's side?

15:00.336 --> 15:03.737
I thought it was
because you're Kurusu's friend.

15:03.940 --> 15:07.842
But that's not true.
You've also been watching Hazumu.

15:07.977 --> 15:09.945
For a very long time...

15:10.646 --> 15:13.581
I guess you're not as
thickheaded as Tomari.

15:15.651 --> 15:18.518
But that's not the right answer.

15:19.922 --> 15:21.719
I guess you're half right.

15:21.824 --> 15:23.189
Half right?

15:23.626 --> 15:26.356
You have nothing to worry about.

15:29.132 --> 15:30.258
Okay...

15:33.736 --> 15:36.204
Something just moved...

15:39.075 --> 15:40.276
Someone's on the floor!

15:40.276 --> 15:42.608
Someone's on the floor!
Hey, calm down.

15:43.412 --> 15:45.380
It's a ghost!

15:46.716 --> 15:49.184
G-G-G...

15:49.352 --> 15:52.048
Ghost... A ghost...

15:52.255 --> 15:53.722
Miss Namiko?

15:55.091 --> 15:57.423
Hazumu, it's Miss Namiko.

15:58.594 --> 15:59.561
Hazumu.

16:01.063 --> 16:02.189
Yasuna...

16:02.832 --> 16:03.890
What's wrong?

16:04.066 --> 16:07.866
Well, it seems like
Miss Namiko saw something...

16:07.970 --> 16:09.460
Stop it!

16:09.572 --> 16:13.872
Just let go of me! You'll scare
the ghosts if you scream that much!

16:18.548 --> 16:20.516
Curses upon you.

16:34.730 --> 16:36.197
Mr. Sora...

16:36.399 --> 16:41.769
Hazumu left you two and ran away.
I guess it was unsuccessful...

16:44.540 --> 16:47.475
You two continue with
the test of courage.

16:48.477 --> 16:50.011
It's just my imagination, right?

16:50.012 --> 16:51.070
It's just my imagination, right?
No!

16:51.247 --> 16:53.010
I'm going home!

16:53.082 --> 16:57.348
Hazumu's unbelievable.
Let's get this over with.

16:57.453 --> 17:00.013
Wait for me, Tomari!

17:01.791 --> 17:03.224
You too, Yasuna.

17:04.760 --> 17:06.159
Hurry up.

17:07.697 --> 17:08.664
Okay.

17:13.970 --> 17:15.096
It's me.

17:15.204 --> 17:18.332
Targets are heading there.
I'm counting on you.

17:18.574 --> 17:20.064
Roger that!

17:20.209 --> 17:22.109
They're here.

17:26.315 --> 17:30.046
They totally forgot about me, no?

17:33.656 --> 17:34.520
What?

17:36.692 --> 17:38.216
My mistake.

17:38.628 --> 17:40.220
Oh, it's you!

17:40.396 --> 17:44.025
I'm not like Hazumu,
so I don't get scared that easily.

17:44.133 --> 17:47.102
Then you'll be eaten.

17:47.203 --> 17:50.331
Puu...

17:50.706 --> 17:52.105
What the...

17:53.576 --> 17:56.875
An extraterrestrial named Number 6.

17:57.046 --> 17:59.446
It loves to eat earthlings.

18:01.684 --> 18:05.347
No matter how well this
thing's made, you can't fool me...

18:09.125 --> 18:11.923
I hate it here since it's dark!

18:17.166 --> 18:19.862
Why don't you
leave me alone already?

18:19.969 --> 18:22.995
Don't say that, Tomari!

18:23.339 --> 18:26.308
You're really scared, aren't you?

18:26.542 --> 18:29.807
<i>You showed me
a side I didn't know before.</i>

18:29.912 --> 18:30.970
Yasuna...

18:32.782 --> 18:34.716
Let's go, Hazumu!

18:34.884 --> 18:36.181
What?

18:36.886 --> 18:40.549
Is this what Mr. Sora wanted to see?

18:40.656 --> 18:41.623
No!

18:41.724 --> 18:42.850
What?

18:43.025 --> 18:44.117
Asuta?

18:45.661 --> 18:47.094
Hazumu!

18:53.202 --> 18:54.897
No no no!

18:55.104 --> 18:57.231
Hazumu, nice punch...

18:59.175 --> 19:00.107
No!

19:00.209 --> 19:01.176
Hazumu!

19:06.882 --> 19:09.646
It looks like I failed again.

19:09.785 --> 19:10.911
Puu...

19:13.322 --> 19:14.880
Science

19:18.060 --> 19:19.027
Hazumu?

19:22.098 --> 19:23.759
Ayuki?

19:24.633 --> 19:25.691
What's wrong?

19:25.835 --> 19:29.965
It's terrible! Asuta was eaten
by this weird, slimy ghost!

19:30.106 --> 19:33.735
Okay, okay, can you
get your face off of me?

19:34.410 --> 19:35.672
Sorry.

19:35.778 --> 19:37.211
Hazumu!

19:37.580 --> 19:38.979
Hazumu!

19:39.749 --> 19:44.277
I see. Mr. Sora probably
wanted to scare you with tricks.

19:44.453 --> 19:47.786
He is likely to do those things...

19:48.391 --> 19:50.256
You shouldn't worry.

19:50.893 --> 19:53.259
What were you doing here, Ayuki?

19:54.663 --> 19:56.858
I was looking at butterflies.

19:56.966 --> 19:58.228
Butterflies?

20:02.972 --> 20:04.303
Wow!

20:05.775 --> 20:07.470
Aren't they pretty?

20:07.543 --> 20:08.669
Yeah.

20:08.978 --> 20:13.074
I've enjoyed watching
butterflies ever since I was little.

20:14.550 --> 20:17.747
<i>But I never wanted to be like them...</i>

20:17.853 --> 20:20.617
...or to fly in the air like them.

20:21.991 --> 20:24.459
I'm happy just watching them.

20:24.560 --> 20:25.584
Ayuki...

20:26.462 --> 20:29.329
So I'm not going up on the stage.

20:29.432 --> 20:30.922
I won't try.

20:31.033 --> 20:33.524
<i>No matter how close I am...</i>

20:33.636 --> 20:35.968
Even if it's within my reach...

20:41.710 --> 20:43.610
They're all still here.

20:44.213 --> 20:46.807
I guess nobody's been here.

20:47.883 --> 20:50.010
All right, let's go...

20:50.219 --> 20:51.777
Um, Kurusu.

20:54.690 --> 20:55.714
Thank you.

20:56.659 --> 20:58.388
For what?

20:58.494 --> 21:04.899
I was happy when you asked me
to go to the test of courage...

21:07.603 --> 21:09.230
Call me Tomari.

21:09.972 --> 21:13.499
I call you Yasuna,
so you can call me Tomari.

21:15.211 --> 21:17.111
Then Tomari-san.

21:17.480 --> 21:20.574
You can drop that.
It kind of bothers me.

21:20.950 --> 21:21.850
Really?

21:21.851 --> 21:22.909
Really?
Yeah.

21:31.627 --> 21:33.959
I'm finally here!

21:34.196 --> 21:35.094
Hazumu.

21:35.197 --> 21:36.164
Hazumu.

21:38.167 --> 21:39.964
We're all safe!

21:40.069 --> 21:41.866
What are you talking about?

21:41.971 --> 21:43.905
You're the one who got lost.

21:44.406 --> 21:47.842
Wow! The sky is filled
with beautiful stars!

21:47.977 --> 21:49.001
You're right.

21:49.111 --> 21:50.078
Yeah.

21:50.880 --> 21:53.849
Their wings are still
white when they're born...

21:54.216 --> 21:56.844
...and might tear if they overdo it.

21:57.453 --> 22:00.513
Open up those
painful wings very slowly...

22:00.689 --> 22:03.487
They'll eventually
become brilliantly colored.

22:04.360 --> 22:10.060
<i>I hope your wings don't get hurt.</i>

22:10.199 --> 22:13.566
I hope you can fly through
the sky with those wings.

22:34.023 --> 22:39.791
It's a never-ending blue sky...

22:40.362 --> 22:46.858
<i>...and I reach out
my hand just a little.</i>

22:47.036 --> 22:52.702
You're covered in sparkles...

22:53.442 --> 22:59.438
...and you fly away
without making a noise.

23:01.584 --> 23:07.545
Looking for the truth...
I want to keep...

23:08.057 --> 23:14.587
...watching a stage filled with smiles.

23:16.065 --> 23:22.061
Let's overcome
the sadness and be happy.

23:22.538 --> 23:28.909
<i>Should I put my trust
in a future that I can't see?</i>

23:29.144 --> 23:34.912
The light that is released
will reach you someday...

23:35.618 --> 23:42.888
So let's take it slow...
There's nothing to worry about.

23:45.327 --> 23:49.559
Our future is just around the corner.

23:55.971 --> 23:58.201
<i>Why do I feel so sad?</i>

23:58.307 --> 24:02.073
It's supposed to be a fun festival.
Everyone's here with me.

24:02.177 --> 24:04.839
Next time on Kashimashi
~Girl Meets Girl~.

24:04.947 --> 24:07.142
Will This Wish Come True?

24:07.249 --> 24:09.615
These feelings... in my heart.
